    "detailed_description": "In this game, you find yourself trapped in a seemingly endless parking lot, with the only goal: to escape by reaching Floor Zero. But beware, this is no ordinary parking lot. It's a twisted maze that loops infinitely, playing tricks on your mind and senses.<br><br>If you se an anomaly... <strong>turn back</strong>!<br>If you don't... then <strong>continue</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760600/extras/6def90a91e8557a0e279ed90873aa0f6.poster.avif?t=1732521509\" width=496 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760600/extras/6def90a91e8557a0e279ed90873aa0f6.webm?t=1732521509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760600/extras/6def90a91e8557a0e279ed90873aa0f6.mp4?t=1732521509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES:</h2><strong>Anomalies Detection</strong>: Pay close attention to your surroundings. The key to escaping lies in detecting subtle anomalies. Choose wisely - turn back if you see one or continue if you think there are none. Your observation skills are the key.<br><strong>Infinite Loops</strong>: Each journey through the parking lot is unique. The anomalies change, keeping you on the edge of your seat.<br>Psychological Horror: Immerse yourself in an atmosphere of suspense and dread, with sound design and visuals crafted to unsettle and engage.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760600/extras/9b8139973829d00a81db3fb4759ed431.avif?t=1732521509\" width=500 height=300 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><strong>Intuitive Mechanics</strong>: Simple controls focused on exploration and decision-making.<br><strong>Short but Intense</strong>: Playtime varies from 20-60 minutes, offering a dense and memorable experience.<br><strong>Replay Value</strong>: Multiple playthroughs are encouraged to discover all anomalies and hidden secrets.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760600/extras/bccf90c1f040c1ca45d42432cbd463f5.avif?t=1732521509\" width=500 height=280 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMMUNITY AND SUPPORT</h2><strong>Stream-Friendly</strong>: We welcome and support both individual and corporate streamers. Feel free to monetize your streams using platform-provided functions.<br><strong>Engagement Request</strong>: Help spread the word! Include our game title in your stream titles and a link to this Steam page in your descriptions.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760600/extras/ade119468b58766c2aefcefa8f731991.avif?t=1732521509\" width=500 height=240 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OPTIONS AND ACCESSIBILITY</h2><strong>Customizable Experience</strong>: Adjust graphics settings, mouse sensitivity and more for optimal comfort.",
