laytime varies from 20-60 minutes, offering a dense and memorable experience.<br><strong>Replay Value</strong>: Multiple playthroughs are encouraged to discover all anomalies and hidden secrets.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760600/extras/bccf90c1f040c1ca45d42432cbd463f5.avif?t=1732521509\" width=500 height=280 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMMUNITY AND SUPPORT</h2><strong>Stream-Friendly</strong>: We welcome and support both individual and corporate streamers. Feel free to monetize your streams using platform-provided functions.<br><strong>Engagement Request</strong>: Help spread the word! Include our game title in your stream titles and a link to this Steam page in your descriptions.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760600/extras/ade119468b58766c2aefcefa8f731991.avif?t=1732521509\" width=500 height=240 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OPTIONS AND ACCESSIBILITY</h2><strong>Customizable Experience</strong>: Adjust graphics settings, mouse sensitivity and more for optimal comfort.",
